sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as You
    participant W as Watch app
    participant P as Proxy
    participant A as Your PWA
    U->>W: Tap "Delete" (call action, confirm set)
    W-->>U: Alert "Delete this task?"
    U->>W: Confirm
    W->>P: POST /api/v1/apps/demo/actions/deleteTask<br/>{ payload, params: { id: "3" } }
    P->>P: Look up action in watch.json<br/>url = /demo/api/tasks/{{params.id}}
    P->>A: DELETE /demo/api/tasks/3
    A-->>P: 200 { ok: true }
    P->>P: Invalidate cached data for this app
    P-->>W: { ok: true, message: "Deleted", then: "pop" }
    W-->>U: ✓ haptic + toast "Deleted"
    W->>W: then = pop → go back, reload list
    W->>W: Reload complication timelines
